  "notes": "Orchestrator generalisation of 5d536a0608217df6 (grok-4.7, S3 round 4). phi = a*e + k + c*u, e = inversions read from token 1 + positional excess, k = shorter distance to the nearest improving cell, u = tokens whose counterclockwise neighbour is a zero or a larger token (token 1 always counts). Rotation: k drops by 1, e and u fixed. Improving X: e drops by 1; the swapped pair dies and new improving cells can appear only at distance <= 1, so k' >= 2 gives du <= -1 and k' <= 1 gives du <= +1. Descent needs a >= c + 2 and a + c >= floor(n/2) + 1; c = floor(n/4), a = c + 2 satisfy both for every n. Equal to 5d536a0608217df6 for 8 <= n <= 11, smaller for n <= 7."
